<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361398" n="1"/>
  <opener>
      <lb/><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> et <abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Viro <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></opener>
  <p>
      <lb/>Accepi ante aliquot dies <rs key="B_991170517056305501" type="letter">epistolam</rs> tuam eruditissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>m<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> cum solutione problematis de determinan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>da figura canalis <add>flexibilis</add> viribus <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualibus cuiusvis flui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di undique pressi aut tracti deducta a tua
      <lb/>solutione generali, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> invenisti vires pellen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tes esse radio circuli osculantis in unoquoque
      <lb/>puncto reciproce proportionales. Tuam solu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> generalem publicam te <choice><sic>permitente</sic><corr>permittente</corr></choice>
      <lb/>faciam quando meam <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs> typis
      <lb/>tradam. Problema quod <abbr>Doctiss.</abbr><hi rend="sup">o</hi> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruo</rs>
      <lb/>Tuo proposui Tibi quoque propono
      <lb/>hac die qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basileam</rs> mitto ad <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patru<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>et <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Patruelem</rs>
<rs key="B_991170515152705501" type="letter">litteras</rs><note type="comment">Michelotti sandte am selben Tag einen <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515152705501">Brief</rs> an Johann I mit einem beigelegten Schreiben an dessen Sohn Nicolaus II. Die Beilage ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt.</note>. Sit canalis qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cumque flexibilis et elasticus in quem
      <lb/>viribus datis inijciatur continue liquor
      <lb/>qualiscunque ita ut liquoris ipsius fluxus
      <lb/>per canalem elastic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> sit continuus et
      <lb/>nunquam interruptus.<del> Fiat autem</del> Deter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>minare oportet (abstrahendo a resistentiis
<pb facs="1361400" n="2"/>
      <lb/>velocitatem liquoris fluentis per longitu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dinem canalis. Deinde facto emissario in
      <lb/>quovis dato canalis loco aut puncto ita
      <lb/>ut liquor continu<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> viribus datis et
      <lb/>nunquam cessantibus in cavitatem canalis
      <lb/>proiectus effluere possit et de facto effluat
      <lb/>per emissari<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Determinanda est velocitas
      <lb/>sanguinis per emissari<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> effluentis etiam
      <lb/>abstrahendo a crassitie liquoris, asperitate
      <lb/>emissarii et id genus aliis. Id vero deter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>minare oportet pro quolibet situ
      <lb/>canalis aut verticalis, aut horizontalis,
      <lb/>aut inclinati. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c Vir Amicissime applican<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>da deinde erunt Sanguini viribus con<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tractilibus Cordis proiecti in arterias,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sunt canales conici flexibiles et elastici
      <lb/>a sinistra cordis cavitate initi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ducentes
      <lb/>sive in eandem patentes aut <subst><del>i</del><add>h</add></subst>iantes. Rem
      <lb/>in abstracto Tibi propono ut valeas solu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> mathematice exhibere non
      <lb/>considerando resistentias et impedimenta.
<pb facs="1361401" n="3"/>
      <lb/>C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ut possis concipere non esse interupt<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>sanguinis mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in arteriis h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> haben<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tu<subst><del>m</del><add>r</add></subst> in <abbr>Clariss.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gulielmini</rs> <rs key="biblio_EAMI3MDF" type="biblio">libello De san<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>guinis Natura et Constitutione Tibi com<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>munico</rs>. En eius verba<choice><orig>.</orig><reg>:</reg></choice> <quote type="long"><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>Circa motum San<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>guinis observand<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> est, quod licet a causa
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice><del>non continua </del>fiat, non continu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>, sed
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>reciproca vi agente, siquidem<del> dilatationi</del>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice><del>cordis </del>constrictioni cordis immediate suc<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice><del>c</del>cedit dilatatio, cuius tempore nulla fit san<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>guinis a cordis sinibus extrusio; nihilominus
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>tamen per arterias continuus et nunquam
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>interpolatus est Sanguinis motus, ita ut in
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>Statu naturali nulla sit assignabilis vel mini<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>ma differentia temporis, quo Sanguis per arte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>rias non procedat versus corporis circum<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>ferenti<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, et simul per venas <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> circumfe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>rentia non remeet versus cor; id quod pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>ceteris liquet ex iis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> observantur in mis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>sione Sanguinis, in qua uniformi semper
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>fluento Sanguis erumpit a vulnere ven<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>flicto, non per subsultus, ut contingeret
<pb facs="1361402" n="4"/>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>si par in vasis ac in corde esset sanguinis agi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>tatio. Ut hoc artifici<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> paucis, et ante <rs key="pers_DE-588-118659359" type="person">Borell<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>et <rs key="pers_DE-588-117584363" type="person">Bellin<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> nemini cognit<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, clarius elu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>cescat, libet in hoc argumento paulisper
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>immorari, ostendendo tum modum, quo
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>perennis iste sanguinis fluxus succedit,
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>et organa e<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> conducentia.</quote> H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c Clariss. <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lielminus</rs> in <rs key="biblio_EAMI3MDF" type="biblio">libello</rs> citato:<del> Ubi</del> ubi Ana<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tomes et Hydrometri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> subsidio ostendit
      <lb/>quod motus Sanguinis in arteriis (idest in
      <lb/>canalibus qu<choice><orig><g ref="#igrav">ì</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> dilatantur altern<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> ab impetu
      <lb/>sanguinis currentis vi cordis, et altern<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>
      <lb/>constringuntur propter eor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> vim elastic<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice><subst><del>.</del><add>)</add></subst>
      <lb/><add>est continuus.</add> Considera ergo Tu Vir Doctissime Sanguin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ut
      <lb/>liquorem perfecte fluid<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Considera arteriam ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnam ut canalem sine asperitatibus flexibilem
      <lb/>tamen ac dilatabilem ab impetu liquoris proiecti
      <lb/>viribus datis ipsius cordis, constringibilem ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>vi sua elastica. Determinare debes velocitatem
      <lb/><del>hui </del>istiusmodi liquoris fluentis per cavitatem
      <lb/>et longitud<subst><del>em</del><add>inem</add></subst> dicti canalis, nec non celeritatem
      <lb/>eiusdem effluentis <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> vulnere canali ipsi inflicto.</p>
<pb facs="1361403" n="5"/>
  <p>
      <lb/>Considera principi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, medi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> et fin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> dilatationis
      <lb/>arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quum sanguis a Corde constricto proiec<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tus incidit quaquavers<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quiescen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tis datique diametri cavitatem ac latera:
      <lb/>nam dilatatio arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> non uno momento
      <lb/>fit sed su<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> habet principi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, medi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, ac
      <lb/>fin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>. Considera an distractilia qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cunque
      <lb/>minus distractioni repugnent in principio,
      <lb/>et exinde semper magis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> antecedenter
      <lb/>distractiora sunt. Hoc enim supponit <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lielminus</rs>. Rogo ut de his omnibus serio co<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gites<del> et</del> tuaque cogitata quum Tibi tempus
      <lb/>supererit mihi communices. <del>Evi</del>
  </p>
  <p>
      <lb/><quote type="long">Evidens est inquit <rs key="pers_DE-588-117689548" type="person">Pitcarnius</rs> (comparaturus
      <lb/>quantitates liquor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> per vasa maioris et mi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>noris orificii dato tempore effluenti<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>) quod
      <lb/>in quocunque animali quadratum diametri
